<title>ESTONIA: RADIO NOON HEADLINES- MAY 2.</title>
<headline>RADIO NOON HEADLINES- MAY 2.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines reported by Kuku Radio on Frdiay at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The Estonian chamber of commerce and industry has asked the government to make investment tax free.</p>
<p>- Chechnya and Russia may sign a peace treaty next week.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
